TI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"WBddJ9h_3-El2weqkPtddQ","review_id":"_L4Hq45yz72AhsFdMKiHbg","date":"2021-07-28T23:52:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9277822971343994,"text_excerpt":"Food is very good. I live in the neighborhood, so I am getting pretty familiar with the menu. The crab cakes plate was totally good. I love the pontchartrain soft shell crab appetizers. The 3 taco appetizer are so filling as well. Someone told me the stuffed pepper platte is a must. I will send a review on it Enough about the food, the place itself is always clean. Try to get there before 11:30 because there is always a crowded for lunch. People order a lot of food and eat and drink fora minute. The staff is really very friendly even though it can be hectic in there. The food is worth the wait"},{"business_id":"WBddJ9h_3-El2weqkPtddQ","review_id":"KFMs2waSyROywdeL7ltx_A","date":"2021-11-07T14:26:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9207525253295898,"text_excerpt":"We swung through to grab some food to go to bring over to a friend's house for snacks, and PeeWee's came through on all fronts. We called ahead and our order was ready in about 20 minutes. We got a lump crab salad, which was perfect - actually a huge salad! The crab was a solid amount, as well. We got two lump crab cakes, which surprised me in terms of how big they are. I grew up in the Chesapeake Bay area (Maryland and Virginia) and the crab cakes in that region are much smaller and condensed, where PeeWee's are HUGE and a bit thinner. I cannot complain about these crab cakes at ALL, they were big and really unique. They have sort of a sweet chili sauce that comes with them, as well, whi..."},{"business_id":"WBddJ9h_3-El2weqkPtddQ","review_id":"rhBHdbtHXeEWUaFGkLFYXQ","date":"2021-10-28T11:17:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8728668689727783,"text_excerpt":"So I saw a review from a influencer and decided to try it.. I was not disappointed I got the loaded seafood potato and it was amazing. It had a creamy Cajun crawfish sauce with shrimp fish and crab cake on top of a cheesy baked potato."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"WBddJ9h_3-El2weqkPtddQ","photo_id":"VbpvZnEEG0pNH5MclMXz3Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VbpvZnEEG0pNH5MclMXz3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
